<t tx="ekr.20180930062351.49">https://github.com/leo-editor/leo-editor/issues/932

Commands that *DO* use the printer:

    print-body
    print-html
    print-node
    print-expanded-body
    print-expanded-html
    print-marked-bodies
    print-marked-html
    print-marked-nodes
    print-tree-bodies
    print-tree-html
    print-tree-nodes

Commands that *DON'T* use the printer:

    gc-show-summary
    show-all-uas
    show-bindings
    show-buttons
    show-commands
    show-focus
    show-node-uas
    show-plugin-handlers
    show-plugins-info
    show-settings
    show-stats
    show-style-sheet
</t>
